{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Taylor Swift 在典禮開始前一刻悄悄現身 MTV 音樂錄影帶大獎，成為「Patient Zero」歌手自結婚以來首次踏上紅地毯。</p>\n<p>Taylor Swift 身穿一襲華麗的黑銀色長裙，側面透視設計配襯一雙超高跟銀色高跟鞋，盡顯高佻身型。</p>\n<img alt=\"A Swiftie smize! \" src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6ab9a71018000010dcf1528d.jpeg?cache=HngM9dHDAs&amp;ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img alt=\"Swift wore a more muted makeup look, reminiscent of her look in her “Patient Zero” video. \" src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6ab9a9f918000060dcf15290.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img alt=\"Taylor Swift attends the 2026 MTV Video Music Awards at Peacock Theater on Sunday in Los Angeles.\" src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6ab9a616180000f8dbf1528c.jpeg?cache=WQWLRpAneK&amp;ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<img alt=\"Swift was one of the last celebs to walk the red carpet. \" src=\"https://img.huffingtonpost.com/asset/6ab9aad71800006bdcf15291.jpeg?ops=scalefit_720_noupscale\"/>\n<p>外界一直猜測這位「Babylon」歌手會以甚麼造型亮相，因為她自七月在麥迪遜廣場花園與 NFL 球星 Travis Kelce 結婚後便未曾再踏紅地毯，當時婚禮有逾千名賓客出席。</p>\n<p>Kelce 未有出席，因為 Kansas City Chiefs 周日要對陣 Miami Dolphins。</p>\n<p>Taylor Swift 今屆共獲九項提名，她將會成為 VMAs 史上獲獎最多的藝人，打破與 Beyoncé 的紀錄持平局面。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-28T23:38:42.071693+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":690,"images":4,"source":"HuffPost 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}